<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Conjurer Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Conjurers' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>).
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to
Armor Soft Leather       0   75%
Consider                 0   80%
Diagnostics              0   80%
Fleeing                  0   60%
Scroll Use               0   100%
Wand Use                 0   100%
</pre>
